  <main id="main" class="at-page">
    <section class="at-hero wrap" id="top"><a class="at-back" href="/work/connected-agents/"><Icon name="arrow-left" /> The connected agents story</a><div class="at-hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">Attention / A native interface for a terminal task</p><h1>A Mac answer<br /> <em>returns to the terminal.</em></h1></div><div class="at-intro"><p>Codex is building a workshop page. It needs a layout choice. Attention brings the question into the Mac app, then carries the native answer back to the same running task.</p><a class="button button-dark" href="#at-film">Watch the 46-second round trip <Icon name="play" /></a></div></div><p class="at-hero-meta"><span><Icon name="check" /> Actual terminal and Mac app</span><span>One original layout call</span><span>A real responsive file</span></p></section>
    <div class="wrap"><AttentionLab /></div>
  </main>
